of BlackRock, Inc.

On May 7, 2026, BlackRock's holding in Metso's shares amounted to 41,889,018
shares or 5.05 percent of total shares and votes. BlackRock's holding through
financial instruments in Metso amounted to 3,173,881 shares, which corresponds
to 0.38 percent of the total amount of Metso's shares. As a result, BlackRock's
total position amounted to 45,062,899 or 5.43 percent of Metso's shares and
votes. Metso's total number of shares and voting rights is 828,972,440.

